WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.610 --> 00:00:02.790
Again, as many of you know, I like Bernie
Sanders a lot.

00:00:02.790 --> 00:00:04.250
I think he has great policies.

00:00:04.250 --> 00:00:08.290
He's one of the most progressive candidates
running along with Elizabeth Warren.

00:00:08.290 --> 00:00:13.769
I'd be thrilled for Bernie Sanders to be the
Democratic nominee and take on Donald Trump.

00:00:13.769 --> 00:00:18.840
But when people I like do something I disagree
with, I say it and Bernie Sanders has made

00:00:18.840 --> 00:00:25.220
a major mistake and naming a woman named Linda
Sarsour as a campaign surrogate.

00:00:25.220 --> 00:00:30.270
Now I know I'm going to get crushed for this
by a sliver of the left.

00:00:30.270 --> 00:00:34.770
People may cancel paid memberships, they'll
be angry that I have the audacity to call

00:00:34.770 --> 00:00:39.460
out a woman who happens to be Muslim identity
politics argument.

00:00:39.460 --> 00:00:43.820
But I am making the effort not to self-censor
and I just see this as a mistake.

00:00:43.820 --> 00:00:48.350
Linda Sarsour is from the toxic wing of the
American left.

00:00:48.350 --> 00:00:54.820
She, uh, is someone who has played coy with
and refused to denounce antisemitic nation

00:00:54.820 --> 00:00:57.210
of Islam leader Louis Farrakhan.

00:00:57.210 --> 00:01:01.800
She is someone who has participated in marginalizing
Jewish women in her role as founder of the

00:01:01.800 --> 00:01:04.220
women's March, which I've previously talked
about.

00:01:04.220 --> 00:01:07.690
I don't believe Bernie Sanders should have
anything to do with Linda Sarsour.

00:01:07.690 --> 00:01:09.860
This is simply a mistake, plain and simple.

00:01:09.860 --> 00:01:15.750
The Bernie campaign over the weekend tweeted
a video of Linda Sarsour speaking where she

00:01:15.750 --> 00:01:22.330
is identified merely as a civil rights activist
and 2020 surrogate of Bernie Sanders.

00:01:22.330 --> 00:01:26.340
But the truth is that she has a very, very
ugly past.

00:01:26.340 --> 00:01:29.430
Again, Linda Sarsour is a founder of the women's
March.

00:01:29.430 --> 00:01:34.220
She's one of the three founders I've told
you about before, along with Tamika Mallory

00:01:34.220 --> 00:01:39.659
and Bob Bland, who allowed antisemitism to
pervade the movement, who didn't consider

00:01:39.659 --> 00:01:45.670
Jewish women important to the movement and
marginalize them who played coy and Rick cozy

00:01:45.670 --> 00:01:51.020
with antisemitic extremist nation of Islam
leader Louis Farrakhan, who I've widely denounced

00:01:51.020 --> 00:01:52.020
before.

00:01:52.020 --> 00:01:53.020
And it shouldn't be difficult.

00:01:53.020 --> 00:01:57.740
Anyone who cares about civil rights and non-discrimination
and inclusion, no matter what your political

00:01:57.740 --> 00:01:59.860
ideology is, you should just announced Louis
Farrakhan.

00:01:59.860 --> 00:02:03.430
It shouldn't be difficult and Bernie should
have nothing to do with this.

00:02:03.430 --> 00:02:09.890
And in fact, she has blamed white women for
the anti-abortion heartbeat bill that Georgia

00:02:09.890 --> 00:02:11.349
tried to pass.

00:02:11.349 --> 00:02:17.500
She has defended Sharia law in a series of
tweets trying to put a positive spin on it.

00:02:17.500 --> 00:02:20.930
Other left and democratic groups have figured
this out.

00:02:20.930 --> 00:02:26.989
For example, the DNC ended in support of the
women's March over exactly what I've described

00:02:26.989 --> 00:02:28.310
to you before.

00:02:28.310 --> 00:02:33.270
Having people like Linda Sarsour in the picture
is what hurts our own credibility.

00:02:33.270 --> 00:02:35.970
I don't care about Linda Sarsour personally.

00:02:35.970 --> 00:02:43.510
Uh, this is about what this does to the movement
to have people like this involved.

00:02:43.510 --> 00:02:46.040
Even on the Israeli Palestinian conflict.

00:02:46.040 --> 00:02:49.400
It quite frankly, it doesn't seem like Linda
Sarsour and Bernie Sanders are on the same

00:02:49.400 --> 00:02:50.400
page.

00:02:50.400 --> 00:02:53.500
Bernie has repeated many times when Israel
is attacked by rockets.

00:02:53.500 --> 00:02:55.099
It has a right to defend itself.

00:02:55.099 --> 00:02:59.880
He makes clear he's not going to play the
demonization games that lots of people like

00:02:59.880 --> 00:03:02.820
Belinda Sar sewer play, we just don't need
them.

00:03:02.820 --> 00:03:08.780
All of the productive views that Linda Sarsour
might hold are held by plenty of people who

00:03:08.780 --> 00:03:13.360
aren't toxic and who aren't associated with
people like Louis Farrakhan.

00:03:13.360 --> 00:03:14.560
She wants Medicare for all.

00:03:14.560 --> 00:03:15.849
Great, so do I.

00:03:15.849 --> 00:03:19.320
She wants tuition free college and a $15 minimum
wage.

00:03:19.320 --> 00:03:20.870
Lots of people on the left do.

00:03:20.870 --> 00:03:23.760
There's no reason to make her a surrogate
for Bernie Sanders.

00:03:23.760 --> 00:03:24.900
It's not my left.

00:03:24.900 --> 00:03:27.010
I'm actually surprised.

00:03:27.010 --> 00:03:31.620
This is even something that Bernie Sanders
would entertain given his track record.

00:03:31.620 --> 00:03:36.150
He may simply have no idea what's going on
with Linda Sarsour, but I would encourage

00:03:36.150 --> 00:03:42.110
the left not to dabble with this toxic wing
because there is literally no upside.

00:03:42.110 --> 00:03:44.510
There is no policy upside.

00:03:44.510 --> 00:03:46.840
There's no ideological upside.

00:03:46.840 --> 00:03:49.069
There's no public relations upside.

00:03:49.069 --> 00:03:53.120
Even if you don't personally find Linda Sarsour
problematic, even though I believe that you

00:03:53.120 --> 00:03:59.250
should, there is no strategic argument to
be made for her involvement and Bernie Sanders

00:03:59.250 --> 00:04:00.250
campaign.

00:04:00.250 --> 00:04:01.250
Period.

00:04:01.250 --> 00:04:05.120
Now, if you disagree with me, let me know,
but try to do it in a way that's respectful,

00:04:05.120 --> 00:04:06.120
right?

00:04:06.120 --> 00:04:10.510
Let's, let's see if you can actually do that
because I know exactly what I'm bracing for

00:04:10.510 --> 00:04:12.530
